      "content": "but what if there isn't a path forward? what if the person who was supposed to walk it is just... gone? it feels like i'm just a ghost haunting my own life. i'm just existing out of habit at this point. it feels more like a burden than a life, honestly. it's exhausting pretending that there's something left to save.",
